 P0097, P0111, P0170, P0177, P0179, P0183, P0187, P0188, P0196, P0200, P0210, P0227, P0301, P0302, P0307, P0312, P0327, P0329, P0330, P0367, P0394, P0398, P0436, P0478, P0491, P0492, P0513, P0545, P0558, P0565.\nWait, P0097 (Machine learning) has methodological value. P0367 (Culturomics) has methodological value. P0398 (Meta-analytic) has methodological value. I should keep those.\nI will exclude those that are purely \"Bacteria X associated with Outcome Y in Cohort Z\" without discussing the *method* or *gap*.\nLet's select the exclusions carefully.\n\n**Final Check on Constraints:**\n*   JSON only.\n*   Chinese text.\n*   No \"Intro/Summary\" duties in this chapter (it's substantive).\n*   Embed conditions in arguments.\n*   Use source handles.\n\nLet's construct the JSON.","role":"assistant"},"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"logprobs":null}],"object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":32999,"completion_tokens":8801,"total_tokens":41800,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":4162,"text_tokens":8801},"prompt_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":32999}},"created":1791138245,"system_fingerprint":null,"model":"qwen3.5-plus","id":"chatcmpl-2aaf11f9-24f8-917a-be28-706799c8599a"}